# "Before" previews for the visual polish (2026-10-22): the window as 0.5.1 draws it on the
# owner's desktop (Omarchy's tokyo-night, Hyprland rounding 8) and outside Omarchy (the built-in
# palette), at the M1 Pro's logical size (3024 × 1964 at scale 2), with a conversation open and a
# docked composer. Kept so the same frames can be drawn by an older build, which knows neither
# `palette` nor the new look. Every name, address and message is fictional.
# Not run by CI: it writes into tools/progress/public/.
# Run: tools/headless.sh 45 target/debug/pronto --self-test tests/selftest/preview-visual-polish-before.sealwax-test

desktop tiling
resize 1512 982
theme tokyo-night
corners 8
triage-mark-read-on-open false
composer-backend stand-in
conversation-account Personal alex.berg@example.test
conversation-add singles
conversation-add trip
focus list
conversation-show trip-6
wait-until assert-quick-reply shown true
screenshot $DIR/../../tools/progress/public/visual-polish-before-tokyo-night-reader-2026-10-22.png

action win.compose
composer-wait
composer-type "kari@example.test,"
composer-focus subject
composer-type "Friday's board games"
composer-focus body
composer-insert "Hi Kari, I'll bring Wingspan and the snacks. See you at seven!"
screenshot $DIR/../../tools/progress/public/visual-polish-before-tokyo-night-composer-2026-10-22.png
composer-click composer-minimize

theme none
conversation-show trip-6
screenshot $DIR/../../tools/progress/public/visual-polish-before-builtin-reader-2026-10-22.png
